Source: minti-pack-hermes3
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: MINTI Project <minti@localhost>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: minti-pack-hermes3
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 minti-pack-fetch (>= 0.1)
Recommends:
 ollama
Description: MINTI addon — Hermes 3 8B chat model
 Pulls the Nous Hermes 3 8B agent-tuned chat model (Llama-3.1 base) into the
 local Ollama install via `minti-pack-fetch hermes3`. Once installed,
 minti-runtime and any client of /v1/chat/completions can address it as
 `hermes3:8b`.
 .
 Size: ~4.7 GB on disk, ~5 GB RAM at load (Q4_K_M quant). Fits on an 8 GB
 RAM host alongside one other 7-8B model loaded one-at-a-time.
 .
 Postinst calls `minti-pack-fetch hermes3`. Set MINTI_PACK_NO_FETCH=1 in the
 environment when installing to defer the actual download — the operator
 then runs `sudo minti-pack-fetch hermes3` when bandwidth and disk allow.
